ngst guitarists and some what keyboard players, the integration of audio processing and the interaction between the instrument and\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"","width":0,"height":0},"classes":[]},{"id":162,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/10\/10\/music-bjorn-charles-dreyer-group\/","url_meta":{"origin":1105,"position":3},"title":"Music &#8211; Bj\u00f8rn Charles Dreyer Group","date":"October 10, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"Bj\u00f8rn Charles Dreyer Group is a product of Dreyer's master studies at the University of Agder. I was doing a bachelor degree at the same University, and he invited me to be a part of his project, you can read his master thesis here. The master degree ran over a\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2013\/05\/p162.jpg?fit=607%2C1080&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":401,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/11\/01\/dancers\/","url_meta":{"origin":1105,"position":4},"title":"Dancers","date":"November 1, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"As stated in my project description: - Look at the possibilities for at external sources, such as the audience, a net stream, dancers, humidity, lights etc. can control the development in the music and in the video trough out a performance by using alternative sensors, controllers and programs. I want\u2026","rel":"","context":"In &quot;ALL&quot;","img":{"alt_text":"","src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/drumsandelectronics.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2013\/05\/p401.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&ssl=1&resize=350%2C200","width":350,"height":200},"classes":[]},{"id":25,"url":"https:\/\/drumsandelectronics.com\/2011\/09\/13\/signal-flow\/","url_meta":{"origin":1105,"position":5},"title":"Signal-flow","date":"September 13, 2011","format":false,"excerpt":"The audio from my EMFit based contact microphones goe